          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "23q_wcp_hny",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《宋書》及北朝兩史所見，劉宋冀州刺史，鎮歷城。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-088-song88:p002",
      "text": "道固不受命，遣子景微、軍主傅靈越率眾赴安都。",
